ue: 49.520 (bold)\">49.520</div>\n<div class=\"text-right font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-4-3\" data-name=\"Goodput value: 171.896 (bold)\">171.896</div>\n<div class=\"text-right font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-4-4\" data-name=\"Deadline misses value: 11.811 (bold)\">11.811</div>\n<div class=\"text-right font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-4-5\" data-name=\"Collisions value: 2.107 (bold)\">2.107</div>\n<div class=\"text-right font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-4-6\" data-name=\"Wasted vacancy value: 15.567 (bold)\">15.567</div>\n<div class=\"text-right font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-4-7\" data-name=\"Jain fairness value: 0.651 (bold)\">0.651</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-[320px_repeat(6,1fr)] items-center h-[35px] border-b border-[#10171D]/12 text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-5\" data-name=\"table row: NeuroSpectrum\">\n<div class=\"text-[14px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-5-1\" data-name=\"row label: NeuroSpectrum\">NeuroSpectrum, hard sensing</div>\n<div class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-5-2\" data-name=\"QoS value: 43.115\">43.115</div>\n<div class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-5-3\" data-name=\"Goodput value: 156.635\">156.635</div>\n<div class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-5-4\" data-name=\"Deadline misses value: 12.600\">12.600</div>\n<div class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-5-5\" data-name=\"Collisions value: 7.604\">7.604</div>\n<div class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-5-6\" data-name=\"Wasted vacancy value: 23.399\">23.399</div>\n<div class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-5-7\" data-name=\"Jain fairness value: 0.658\">0.658</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-[320px_repeat(6,1fr)] items-center h-[35px] border-b border-[#10171D]/12 text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-6\" data-name=\"table row: NeuroSpectrum\">\n<div class=\"text-[14px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-6-1\" data-name=\"row label: NeuroSpectrum\">NeuroSpectrum, BC only (no RL)</div>\n<div class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-6-2\" data-n