-center h-[30px] border-b border-[rgba(28,19,22,0.07)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-7\" data-name=\"deadline misses row\">\n<div class=\"text-[12.5px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-7-1\" data-name=\"deadline misses metric name\">Deadline misses</div>\n<div class=\"tnum text-right text-[12.5px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-7-2\" data-name=\"Proportional Fair deadline miss value\">30.690%</div>\n<div class=\"tnum text-right text-[12.5px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-7-3\" data-name=\"NeuroSpectrum deadline miss value\">28.235%</div>\n<div class=\"tnum text-right text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-7-4\" data-name=\"deadline misses change percentage\">+8.0% <span class=\"text-[10px] text-[#1C1316]/50\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-7-4-1\" data-name=\"deadline misses change direction label\">better</span></div>\n<div class=\"pl-6 pr-[168px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-7-5\" data-name=\"deadline misses comparison bar container\"><div class=\"h-[3px] bg-[rgba(28,19,22,0.22)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-7-5-1\" data-name=\"Proportional Fair deadline miss bar\" style=\"width:100%\"></div><div class=\"mt-[3px] h-[3px] bg-[#1C1316]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-7-5-2\" data-name=\"NeuroSpectrum deadline miss bar\" style=\"width:92%\"></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-[188px_104px_130px_120px_1fr] items-center h-[30px] border-b border-[rgba(28,19,22,0.07)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-8\" data-name=\"incumbent collisions row\">\n<div class=\"text-[12.5px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-8-1\" data-name=\"incumbent collisions metric name\">Incumbent collisions</div>\n<div class=\"tnum text-right text-[12.5px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-8-2\" data-name=\"Proportional Fair collisions value\">7.115%</div>\n<div class=\"tnum text-right text-[12.5px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-8-3\" data-name=\"NeuroSpectrum collisions value\">5.304%</div>\n<div class=\"tnum text-right text-[12px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-8-4\" data-name=\"incumbent collisions change percentage\">+25.5% <span class=\"text